      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Here's a 4-week linear progression program to help you build a foundation. **Superset routine**:\n\n- Week 1:\n  - 3 sets of 8 reps, do 4 times: Squats, Bench, Deadlifts\n  - Progress: Increase weight by 2.5-5lbs next week\n- Week 2:\n  - 3 sets of 7 reps, do 3 times: Squats, Bench with incline, Deadlifts\n  - Progress: Increase weight by 2-2.5lbs next week\n- Week 3:\n  - 3 sets of 6 reps, do 2 times: Squats, Deadlifts, Bench press\n  - Progress: Increase weight by 2.5-5lbs next week\n- Week 4:\n  - 3 sets of 5 reps, do 1 time: Squats, Bench press, Deadlifts\n  - Progress: Increase weight by 5-10lbs next week\n\n**Remember to:**\n- Warm up properly before each workout (5-10 minutes of cardio and dynamic stretching)\n- Focus on proper form and technique over the weight you're lifting\n- Rest for",
